<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-BOBIC SIGNS WITH STUTTGART UNTIL 2001.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BOBIC SIGNS WITH STUTTGART UNTIL 2001.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>German international striker Fredi Bobic has extended his contract with VfB Stuttgart until 2001, his club said on Thursday.</p>
<p>European champions Borussia Dortmund and other clubs had expressed interest in the player, who was previously tied to Stuttgart until 1999.</p>
